    "body": "Extra evidence from run 43718974511 (head 8719d8b7a). Only the ui suites step failed. All other steps passed: geometry, kernel, cl, tools, post, sim, motion, app suites (1041 s, bore_core and the other app binaries green), and clippy on all eight crates. So the failure is in the ui suite only, not in the underlying app behaviour.\n\nFailed step: `[09] ui suites (cwd crates/ui)`, command `cargo test -j 6 -p camcraft-ui --no-fail-fast -- --test-threads=6`, FAIL in 78 s. Failed tests:\n\n- `detect_holes_note_tests::detect_holes_on_a_bore_op_with_only_a_wide_hole_is_refused`\n- `detect_holes_note_tests::detect_holes_on_a_bore_op_stores_the_small_hole_and_names_the_wide_one`\n\nThe Actions log carries no assertion text (the gate prints a summary only). The full test output is in the runner log: `/home/ghrunner/runner-work/Camcraft/Camcraft/gate-logs/batch-20261115-132651` on the post-merge runner (uma). The test module is `crates/ui/src/detect_holes_note_tests.rs`. An app-level equivalent is green, which points at a ui-side law or note-text clash from the bulk batch, not at a generator change.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
